    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Car Shop Empire</h2>Start your journey with a small shop and strategically develop it into a leading destination for car parts and accessories. Handle everyday items like oil filters, tires, and brake pads, as well as high-performance components such as V8 OHV engine parts, advanced suspension systems, and sophisticated electronics. Your decisions not only shape the operational aspect of your business but also impact its financial health and market reputation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/afdecb741ea622a99ddbf8e9f9b5f4fc.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/afdecb741ea622a99ddbf8e9f9b5f4fc.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/afdecb741ea622a99ddbf8e9f9b5f4fc.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Inventory Management</h2>Enhance your inventory management skills by handling a wide range of car parts, including alternators, clutch kits, radiators, exhaust systems, and advanced electronic systems essential for modern vehicles. Learn to master the art of inventory control, optimize pricing strategies, and respond to market demand. Watch as your auto shop becomes a local industry leader known for efficiency and reliability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/7665a3c131b018a8693fa66e16d22fd2.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/7665a3c131b018a8693fa66e16d22fd2.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/7665a3c131b018a8693fa66e16d22fd2.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize and Expand Your Shop</h2>Personalize your space using various design options - choose layouts, themes, and decorations that reflect your style to attract more customers. As your business grows, you'll be tasked with expanding the physical space of your shop to accommodate increasing inventory and broaden the range of services offered, from routine maintenance to specialized repairs and custom modifications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/dad86cd5f83dfe93d6c1e2e600ffa494.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/dad86cd5f83dfe93d6c1e2e600ffa494.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/dad86cd5f83dfe93d6c1e2e600ffa494.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Car Parts and Technologies</h2>To stay competitive in the rapidly evolving automotive industry, you must continuously unlock new car parts and technologies. Obtain licenses to sell and install advanced parts that meet the diverse needs of car enthusiasts and professional repair shops. This feature ensures that your shop remains at the forefront of innovation, offering the latest advancements in automotive technology, from hybrid engine components to autonomous vehicle systems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/cdb7fc513895c5e94b904d68eb1270d6.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/cdb7fc513895c5e94b904d68eb1270d6.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/cdb7fc513895c5e94b904d68eb1270d6.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ensure Customer Satisfaction</h2>Listen carefully to customer feedback and adjust your business strategies to meet their expectations. Excellent customer service is key to building a solid customer base that relies on your shop for all their automotive needs, from simple oil changes to complex engine rebuilds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/eb8c7fa8c5694998965e971e6e046b80.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/eb8c7fa8c5694998965e971e6e046b80.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/eb8c7fa8c5694998965e971e6e046b80.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Car Shop Empire</h2>Start your journey with a small shop and strategically develop it into a leading destination for car parts and accessories. Handle everyday items like oil filters, tires, and brake pads, as well as high-performance components such as V8 OHV engine parts, advanced suspension systems, and sophisticated electronics. Your decisions not only shape the operational aspect of your business but also impact its financial health and market reputation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/afdecb741ea622a99ddbf8e9f9b5f4fc.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/afdecb741ea622a99ddbf8e9f9b5f4fc.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/afdecb741ea622a99ddbf8e9f9b5f4fc.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Inventory Management</h2>Enhance your inventory management skills by handling a wide range of car parts, including alternators, clutch kits, radiators, exhaust systems, and advanced electronic systems essential for modern vehicles. Learn to master the art of inventory control, optimize pricing strategies, and respond to market demand. Watch as your auto shop becomes a local industry leader known for efficiency and reliability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/7665a3c131b018a8693fa66e16d22fd2.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/7665a3c131b018a8693fa66e16d22fd2.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/7665a3c131b018a8693fa66e16d22fd2.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize and Expand Your Shop</h2>Personalize your space using various design options - choose layouts, themes, and decorations that reflect your style to attract more customers. As your business grows, you'll be tasked with expanding the physical space of your shop to accommodate increasing inventory and broaden the range of services offered, from routine maintenance to specialized repairs and custom modifications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/dad86cd5f83dfe93d6c1e2e600ffa494.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/dad86cd5f83dfe93d6c1e2e600ffa494.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/dad86cd5f83dfe93d6c1e2e600ffa494.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Car Parts and Technologies</h2>To stay competitive in the rapidly evolving automotive industry, you must continuously unlock new car parts and technologies. Obtain licenses to sell and install advanced parts that meet the diverse needs of car enthusiasts and professional repair shops. This feature ensures that your shop remains at the forefront of innovation, offering the latest advancements in automotive technology, from hybrid engine components to autonomous vehicle systems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/cdb7fc513895c5e94b904d68eb1270d6.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/cdb7fc513895c5e94b904d68eb1270d6.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/cdb7fc513895c5e94b904d68eb1270d6.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ensure Customer Satisfaction</h2>Listen carefully to customer feedback and adjust your business strategies to meet their expectations. Excellent customer service is key to building a solid customer base that relies on your shop for all their automotive needs, from simple oil changes to complex engine rebuilds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/eb8c7fa8c5694998965e971e6e046b80.poster.avif?t=1753731717\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/eb8c7fa8c5694998965e971e6e046b80.webm?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401000/extras/eb8c7fa8c5694998965e971e6e046b80.mp4?t=1753731717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
